- The authors should provide more details on the implementation of the proposed method. For example, how the reversible layers are implemented and how the forward and backward passes are decoupled.
- The experiments are not sufficient. The authors only compare the proposed method with backpropagation on CIFAR-10, ImageNet-32, and ImageNet. It would be better to compare the proposed method with other parallel training methods, such as PipeDream and Diversely Stale Parameters.
